			&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;You can cast each of this feat’s spells without a spell slot once per Long Rest. You can also cast these spells using spell slots you have of the appropriate level. Your spellcasting ability for these spells is Intelligence.&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
