			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Ability Score Increase.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Skill Proficiency.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Expertise.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; Choose one skill in which you have proficiency but lack Expertise. You gain Expertise with that skill.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;sheet display="false" /&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;rules&amp;gt;
