			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Keen Observer.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Choose one of the following skills: Insight, Investigation, or Perception. If you lack proficiency with the chosen skill, you gain proficiency in it, and if you already have proficiency in it, you gain Expertise in it.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Quick Search.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; You can take the Search action as a Bonus Action.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/description&gt;
