			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Ability Score Increase.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
