		&amp;lt;sheet&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;When you attack with a weapon that has the Light property, you can make one extra attack as a Bonus Action with a different Melee weapon that lacks the Two-Handed property. You don't add your ability modifier to the extra attack's damage unless that modifier is negative. &amp;amp;#13;
