		&amp;lt;requirements&amp;gt;([character:4],([str:13]||[dex:13]),!ID_PHB_FEAT_SENTINEL)||ID_WOTC_PHB24_GRANTS_FEAT_UNLOCKER&amp;lt;/requirements&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;prerequisite&amp;gt;Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+&amp;lt;/prerequisite&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="flavor"&amp;gt;General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+)&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;You gain the following benefits.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Ability Score Increase.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Guardian.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; Immediately after a creature within 5 feet of you takes the Disengage action or hits a target other than you with an attack, you can make an Opportunity Attack against that creature.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;p class="indent"&amp;gt;&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Halt.&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt; When you hit a creature with an Opportunity Attack, the creature's Speed becomes 0 for the rest of the current turn.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;sheet action="Reaction"&amp;gt;
			&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;Immediately after a creature within 5ft. of you takes the Disengage action or hits a target other than you with an attack, you can make an Opportunity Attack against that creature. &amp;amp;#13;
			Additionally, whenever you hit a creature with an Opportunity Attack, the creature's Speed becomes 0 for the rest of the current turn.&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
